            "Product, batch, tint, color, sheen, and mix records are traceable",
            "Environmental readings and recoat windows are recorded",
            "Coverage, wet film, dry film, adhesion, and coat count are accepted",
            "Edges, cut lines, repairs, and transitions are uniform",
            "Lead, asbestos, mold, or coating-hazard release",
            "Drywall, carpentry, metal, sealant, and substrate repairs",
            "Mechanical ventilation and occupied-air coordination",
            "Electrical device, lighting, and equipment protection"
